# Polymarket international only. polymarket.us is intentionally excluded.
# Verified 2026-10-10: official API docs and public homepage JavaScript.
# https://docs.polymarket.com/api-reference/predictions/overview
# https://polymarket.com/
# The suffix covers website, Gamma/CLOB/Data, relayer/bridge, WS and future subdomains.
# poly.market is the official referral/share short-link domain.
# Dedicated combos API and S3 image bucket are matched by exact hostname.
# No fixed IP-CIDR: Cloudflare/AWS addresses are shared and can change.
# Shared Google/Magic/wallet infrastructure retains its existing route.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,polymarket.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,poly.market
DOMAIN,combos-rfq-api.polymarket.sh
DOMAIN,polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com
